                      Neorism (Vampirism 1.7.10 Backport)
                               Licensing & Notice

================================================================================
                              IMPORTANT NOTICE
================================================================================

This project ("Neorism") is an independent, unofficial backport of the modern
Minecraft mod "Vampirism: Become a Vampire" to Minecraft 1.7.10.

ORIGINAL WORK & INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY:
- Original Mod: "Vampirism: Become a Vampire"
- Original Authors & Maintainers: maxanier and TeamLapen
- Original Repository: https://github.com/TeamLapen/Vampirism
- CurseForge Page: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire
- Official Website: https://vampirism.co

We express our deepest gratitude, sincere appreciation, and full credit to
maxanier, TeamLapen, and all original contributors for creating Vampirism.

BACKPORT AUTHORS:
- MarryBye + Gemini AI

DISCLAIMER & BUG REPORTING:
Any bugs, crashes, performance issues, behavioral differences, or unintended
side effects in this backport (Neorism) are solely the result of this backport
and are the responsibility of the backport maintainers (MarryBye + Gemini AI).
THEY DO NOT REFLECT THE WORK OR QUALITY OF THE ORIGINAL AUTHORS.

ABSOLUTELY DO NOT report issues, bugs, or crash reports from Neorism to the
original Vampirism repository, Discord, or authors. The original authors provide
no support for this backport, and you must never bother them regarding this mod.

